commit 4ceb23d51c26b3e4a0703a519da4a66769db8630

C03: the App treats the written file name as observed data (FILES1713)

In FILES1711 the mind published faithful finals naming the file it had just written («Creé el archivo llamado procesos-memoria.txt con …») and the App's message policy vetoed them as internal_code: its observed-name mask did not know the name returned by filesystem.write.text, so the dotted file name read as an operation identifier. The name returned by a verified filesystem.write.text is now observed data for the App's mask, as it already was for the mind.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


